  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "For most studies a basal salts medium modified from Allen (1959) was used.This medium contains (NH4)2SO4,1.3g; KH2PO4,0.28g; MgSO4 · 7H2O, 0.25 g ; CaCl2 · 2H2O, 0.07 g ; FeCl3 · 6H2O, 0.02 g ; MnCl2 · 4H2O, 1.8 mg ;Na2B4O7 · 10 H2O, 4.5 mg; ZnSO4 · 7H2O, 0.22 mg; CuCl2 · 2H2O, 0.05 mg; NaMoO4 · 2H2O, 0.03 mg; VOSO4 · 2 H2O, 0.03 mg; CoSO4, 0.01 mg; distilled or deionizedwater, 1 l. The pH was adjusted with 10N H2SO4."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}